<html>
  <body style="margin:0; padding:0; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.5; color:#222;">
    <div style="max-width:640px; margin:0 auto; padding:16px;">
      <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">
        Hi $firstName,
      </p>

      <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">
        Your Synapse account (<strong>$userName</strong>) is scheduled to be disabled in 15 days, on <strong>$expirationDate</strong>, due to inactivity.
      </p>

      <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">
        To meet our FISMA-MODERATE requirements, Synapse accounts are disabled after a period of inactivity. This helps us protect user data, maintain security, and ensure that only active accounts retain access to Synapse resources.
      </p>

      <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;">
        If your account is disabled:
      </p>
      <ul style="margin:0 0 16px 20px; padding:0;">
        <li style="margin:0 0 8px 0;">You may lose access to Synapse projects, data, and tools associated with your account.</li>
        <li style="margin:0 0 8px 0;">Collaborators may be impacted if they rely on your account’s access or permissions.</li>
        <li style="margin:0;">Reactivation may require additional steps to verify your identity and restore access.</li>
      </ul>

      <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">
        To understand the full impact and details of account expiry, please review our help article:
        <a href="$helpArticleUrl" style="color:#0b65c2; text-decoration:underline;">Synapse account expiry (help article)</a>
      </p>

      <p style="margin:0 0 8px 0;">
        If you would like to keep your account active, you can reset the expiry countdown by signing in before <strong>$expirationDate</strong>:
      </p>
      <ol style="margin:0 0 16px 20px; padding:0;">
        <li style="margin:0 0 8px 0;">
          Go to the Synapse sign-in page:
          <a href="$signInUrl" style="color:#0b65c2; text-decoration:underline;">$signInUrl</a>
        </li>
        <li style="margin:0 0 8px 0;">Sign in with your existing credentials.</li>
        <li style="margin:0;">Once signed in, your account expiry countdown will be reset automatically.</li>
      </ol>

      <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">
        If you believe you received this message in error, or if you have questions about your account status, please contact us through Synapse Support:
        <a href="$supportUrl" style="color:#0b65c2; text-decoration:underline;">$supportUrl</a>
      </p>

      <p style="margin:0 0 16px 0;">
        Thank you for being part of the Synapse community.
      </p>

      <p style="margin:0;">
        Best regards,<br />
        The Synapse Team
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>